<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Where-to-Find-Properties-at-40-90%-Off?---Marquette-County---Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Where to Find Properties at 40-90% Off? &#8211; Marquette County &#8211; Michigan Tax Deed Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Is it possible to buy real estate at a deep discount in this crazy real estate market? In fact, that is precisely what Marquette County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan,</mark></a> does, selling properties 40 to 90% below market value at the Tax Foreclosure Sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-It-Works\">How It Works</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Marquette County holds two main auctions each year, one in August and another in October, both online. August&#8217;s auction is the primary one, where you need to deposit $1,000, and bidding starts with all taxes and fees included. If you don&#8217;t win an auction, you won&#8217;t get charged.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Auction Phases in Marquette County:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Advance Bidding:</strong> Starts 30 days before the auction. Bidders can adjust bids without seeing others&#8217;.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Active Bidding:</strong> Begins at 10:00 a.m. on auction day. Bidders can see the current high bids until closing at 7:00 p.m. The highest bidder wins and receives payment instructions afterwards.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p>Unsold items move to October&#8217;s auction, which has no minimum bid. Win, and you add a 10% premium to your bid, this year&#8217;s taxes, plus a $30 deed fee. Payment is due in 5 days, with options including wire transfer, certified check, or online via credit/debit card (extra fee applies).</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Marquette-County-in-Northern-Michigan-sits-on-Hilltop-2-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18336 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Marquette County in Northern Michigan sits on Hilltop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Deed-Investing-in-Marquette-County\">Steps to Start Tax Deed Investing in Marquette County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws:</strong> It&#8217;s crucial to know the legal framework in your target area.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website:</strong> Check out the tax sale information available.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site:</strong> Visit <a href=\"http://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> for detailed auction schedules and parcel inquiries.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Auction Details:</strong> Understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiry, and other essential details.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office:</strong> For additional inquiries, contact the Marquette County Treasurer’s Office at (906) 225-8425.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>